 class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">She couldn&#x27;t help bursting into laughter.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">コレクション</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">收藏；收集；时装系列；时装秀</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"143385\"><ruby>世界中<rp>(</rp><rt>せかいじゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>銀<rp>(</rp><rt>ぎん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のティースプーンのコレクションがある。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I have a collection of silver tea spoons from all over the world.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">転がす</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ころがす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">滚动；滚动使移动；驾驶（汽车）；掀翻；弄倒；丢弃；遗弃；倒卖（以获利）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"168794\"><ruby>子供<rp>(</rp><rt>こども</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たちが<ruby>大<rp>(</rp><rt>おお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きな<ruby>雪<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>玉<rp>(</rp><rt>たま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>転<rp>(</rp><rt>ころ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がしていた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The children were rolling a big snowball.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">転がる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ころがる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">滚动；翻滚；翻倒；滚倒；躺下；卧倒；散落；到处都是；（局面或结果）改变；转变；容易得到；随处可得；唾手可得</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang